  type: 0
  trashHints:
  - 'I think I saw something shiny buried in the sand. This could be the last thing
    you need! '
  - 'sometimes I look for cool shells on the beach and stumble upon weird shards...
    I think they would make a great last addition! '
  - "some tourists must have had a party near the mountain - I\u2019ve seen leftovers
    of that material there before. It\u2019s such a shame that they trash this place...
    I think you could add that material as well! "
  - "you ever dig near the mountain rocks and hear a clink instead of a crunch? Silly
    stuff\u2026 but could be a good addition to the recipe\u2026 "
  - 'kids used to play barefoot on the beach before, but now it''s dangerous. They
    might step on something sharp. Hey, you could collect some of these and add them
    to the recipe! '
  materialName: Glass
  sprite: {fileID: 21300000, guid: f8890019003ca3846a5ab004dc39da52, type: 3}
